# Scratch notes and captured run logs. Kept next to the code while debugging a
# specific clip, but they describe one run on one machine and go stale within
# the day, so they are not part of the project. Leading underscore is the
# convention for these.
_*.log
_handoff_*.md

# Scratch clones and upstream sources pulled down to read while integrating a
# dependency. Reference material, not project code -- the reproducible install
# lives in requirements.txt.
.scratch/

